  "term": "knowledge, skills, abilities, and other characteristics",
  "definition": "Knowledge, skills, abilities, and other characteristics (KSAOs) are the personal qualities and competencies a person needs to communicate effectively. In this context, the term is used for communication-related capacities and highlights that these can differ depending on whether communication happens face to face or through text-based digital media.",
